    "FriendlyName": "GamePlatformDeveloperTools",
    "Description": "GamePlatformDeveloperTools（游戏平台开发者工具插件）：UE5.8 Editor Data Validation、资产审计、命令行验证与CI质量门禁；不进入Runtime/Shipping。",
    "Category": "GamePlatform/Diagnostics",
